f.poster.avif?t=1761057417\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250440/extras/d9b2481a98b4cc2e762b35eaac84708f.webm?t=1761057417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250440/extras/d9b2481a98b4cc2e762b35eaac84708f.mp4?t=1761057417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Armory system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks have their own armor system, that greatly reduces receiving damage from the front, and slightly from the sides, so plan your attack accordingly! You can always prepare yourself by locking tank rotation and face the upcoming damage without a scratch! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250440/extras/adc7327f0741c9256dc1f4eb7a1bb76d.poster.avif?t=1761057417\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250440/extras/adc7327f0741c9256dc1f4eb7a1bb76d.webm?t=1761057417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250440/extras/adc7327f0741c9256dc1f4eb7a1bb76d.mp4?t=1761057417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "short_description": "Blast your way to victory in this fast-paced top-down shooter party game! Pilot futuristic hover tanks, unleash incredible turrets and get ready to wreak havoc in chaotic destructible local multiplayer arenas. But most importantly - destroy DEM TANKS!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250440/header.jpg?t=1761057417", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_